},{"client_msg_id":"c27cc207-b595-40d4-a562-1459ef09bb4c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"```cs = [C(), C()]\n[c.nyaa() for c in cs]```\n上にもあるけど、あんまり内包表記で返り値書かないのはないですね….やるとすると `_` に代入して捨てるとか","ts":"1635308431.176800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kwKu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2b4b4f6-23d6-411a-ae40-5c854a269efd","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"普通に map や内包表記で書いて結果はそのまま捨てるということはできます。","ts":"1635308375.175900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDYC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c605be30-e318-49e1-8c31-5e7f371ea833","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"どうしても結果を返したくなかったら式じゃなくて文で書くべきなのでは？ python 的に","ts":"1635308317.174900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5v8j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47281892-51d3-4a85-b80b-02fc1ed5fe3d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"内包系で工夫すればできそう?","ts":"1635308306.174400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CTF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25f608dc-98cc-49d4-b72d-288e43023f03","type":"message","user":"ULPLDSYV8","text":"(いまいちググラビリティ低かったので詳しい人多そうなここで質問しちゃいました)","ts":"1635308021.173300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tH5f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7401db4c-82cc-43ae-a564-c84bbef96fa3","type":"message","user":"ULPLDSYV8","text":"Python って組み込みで for 文の処理を高階関数使って処理する関数あるんでしょうか？\n\nmap() あるのは認識しているんですがこれは list から新しい list を作成してあげたい用途なのかなと思っていて、 map() で戻り値が不要のケースといいますか、 list に対して副作用のある処理をやりたいというケースで適したものがあるのか知りたいなと思っています\n\nこういうのが組み込みであるのかが気になっています\n```def for_each(func, list):\n    for e in list:\n        func(e)```\n```class C:\n    def nyaa(self):\n         print('wan')\n\ncs = [C(), C()]\n\n# こういう使い方をしたい\nfor_each(lambda x: x.nyaa(), cs)\n#=\u0026gt; wan\n#=\u0026gt; wan```","ts":"1635307947.172500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b//C2"}]}]
